/* ==================== 咖啡馆与农场当班插曲 1 ==================== */

:: MP Job Cafe Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
靠窗三号桌的老乐手埃利奥特今天来得比平时早，旧提琴盒靠在椅背上，摊开的手写乐谱旁压着半块柠檬司康。他起身试音时手杖带翻了托盘，滚烫的锡兰红茶正往乐谱和琴盒绒缝里淌；邻桌的报社记者林赛已经掏出速写本，退休领航员温特斯也皱着眉往这边看。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "抢护手写乐谱 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你一把抽走乐谱，用干爽的亚麻餐巾把纸页逐张隔开吸走茶汤，又拿后厨的热烘布裹住琴盒边角，没让半滴茶水渗进绒衬。埃利奥特戴上老花镜逐页翻看，见高音谱号完好无损，欣慰地把赏钱压在杯垫底下。<span class="green">三号桌的孤本乐谱和琴盒都保住了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 580>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_2 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	茶汤已经浸透两页高音谱，纸边一碰就卷。你越擦越花，老乐手沉默地把琴盒扣上，林赛在本子上记了一笔。<span class="red">这段谱子只能重抄了。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢护手写乐谱 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抢护手写乐谱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "用装订法阴干 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
你在孤儿院浆洗房修过受潮旧书，当即取来吧台记账用的吸墨纸夹进湿谱页间，再用重玻璃杯压住四角防卷边。不过片刻，茶渍便被吸得干干净净，连纸页都没起皱。埃利奥特连声称奇，多赏了你一份修谱钱。<span class="green">装订旧书的手艺派上了大用场。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 680>><</if>>
<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_2 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_2 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">用装订法阴干 (0:05)（尚未熟稔旧书装订）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfirstaidicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 210>><<link "温言安抚两位 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你先把三号桌旁的干椅子拉开，请温特斯和林赛稍坐，又轻声跟埃利奥特聊起他年轻时在旧港乐队拉的船歌。老乐手脸色缓下来，索性合上谱夹，还让林赛把这段暖心小事写进明日的市井专栏。<span class="green">窗边重新安静下来，记者也收起了笔。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 460>><</if>>
	<<seductionskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Cafe_3 to ($mpJobReg_Cafe_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	你话还没说完，老乐手已经拎起琴盒起身，林赛合上本子跟着走了。温特斯在旁边敲了敲杯沿。<span class="red">窗边空出一桌没人收拾的狼藉。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[温言安抚两位 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "温言安抚两位">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link "换桌重摆茶点 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
你把湿透的餐巾收走，重新铺好桌布，又替埃利奥特换了一壶温热的红茶与新烤司康。他摆摆手说今天不拉琴了，临走时朝你温和地点了点头。<span class="teal">这一阵忙乱平顺揭过。</span><<stress -1>><<tiredness -1>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Farm Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarmEncounter to 1>>
常来收香草的草药商玛莎蹲在晾晒棚下，指着刚收拢的两大筐干迷迭香直皱眉——新雇的短工割草时手快，把田埂野生的一丛苦艾草也混割了进去。两筐草叶都已经半干卷曲，要是混着送去温泉桑拿房，一蒸出苦味整单都要退回；老佃农巴恩斯正背着草叉从田埂走来。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-farm-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "捻叶辨气分拣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你抓起一把干草在指腹轻轻一捻，凭着叶片背面的白绒毛与微苦樟脑气，十指如飞地把混入的苦艾一株不落地挑了出来，还顺手扎成驱蚊草束。玛莎凑近闻了闻纯正的迷迭香，眉开眼笑地多付了一份分拣赏钱。<span class="green">两筐迷迭香赶在桑拿房来取货前挑得干干净净。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_2 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	干草叶揉碎后气味混作一团，你挑得鼻尖发酸还是漏了几枝苦艾，玛莎只好把半筐草料压了价。<span class="red">指尖染了一层苦草汁，没能拿到加急赏钱。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[捻叶辨气分拣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "捻叶辨气分拣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 210>><<link "温水浮选草叶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你打来一盆净水，取样投入水中观察——迷迭香富含油腺沉降稍慢，而干枯的苦艾叶柄中空浮在表层。你按叶片比重竹筛轻抖，两刻钟便把整筐杂草筛除殆尽。玛莎大加赞赏，当场结了赏钱。<span class="green">巧用比重筛法省下了大半工夫。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_2 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	竹筛抖得太急，好叶和杂叶又缠在一起，你只得蹲在地上重新手挑。<span class="red">腰背酸沉，白费了一番巧思。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[温水浮选草叶 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "温水浮选草叶">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "分装驱蚊香囊 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
你知道温泉桑拿房夏日露台正缺驱蚊草包，便把挑出来的苦艾混上薄荷碎叶，单独扎成十只庭院驱虫香囊。玛莎一看大喜，非但没扣钱，还把这批香囊的利钱分了你一半。<span class="green">原本要扔的杂草变成了桑拿房的紧俏货。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 740>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Farm_2 to ($mpJobReg_Farm_2 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">分装驱蚊香囊 (0:05)（尚未熟稔桑拿房用香）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "摊席慢筛草末 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
你把竹席铺在通风处，请老佃农巴恩斯搭手，两人对着阳光一撮撮把深灰色的苦艾叶挑出去。虽然花了不少工夫，总算没误了玛莎的装车时辰。<span class="teal">两筐香草稳稳当当过了秤。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
